" data-in=\"0.46,0.54\" data-out=\"0.7,0.77\">\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Lo que no ves</span>\n      <h2>Están <em>debajo</em> de la superficie.</h2>\n      <p>Una búsqueda en LinkedIn toma 6 meses en promedio y recibe 500+ candidatos en una semana. Tu CV no es el problema.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cap side\" data-in=\"0.8,0.88\">\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Conexión directa</span>\n      <h2>Ahí se llega por <em>conexión,</em> no por postulación.</h2>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- 8 · COSTO -->\n<section class=\"scene\" id=\"costo\" data-nav=\"pilar-2\" data-theme=\"dark\" data-hook=\"cost\" data-hold=\"80\" style=\"--h:330\">\n  <div class=\"stage dark cost\">\n    <div class=\"inner\">\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">El costo real</span>\n      <p class=\"ttl\" data-in=\"0.02,0.12\">Un closer puede facturar $15,000 USD por mes. Cada mes sin cubrir la posición, se pierde.</p>\n      <div class=\"bigcost\"><span id=\"costNum\">$0</span></div>\n      <div class=\"months\"><div class=\"mo\" data-in=\"0.12,0.22\"><small>Mes 1</small><b>+$15,000</b></div><div class=\"mo\" data-in=\"0.23,0.33\"><small>Mes 2</small><b>+$15,000</b></div><div class=\"mo\" data-in=\"0.34,0.44\"><small>Mes 3</small><b>+$15,000</b></div><div class=\"mo\" data-in=\"0.45,0.55\"><small>Mes 4</small><b>+$15,000</b></div><div class=\"mo\" data-in=\"0.56,0.66\"><small>Mes 5</small><b>+$15,000</b></div><div class=\"mo\" data-in=\"0.67,0.77\"><small>Mes 6</small><b>+$15,000</b></div></div>\n      <p class=\"facts\" data-in=\"0.82,0.94\">Eso pierde una empresa por una sola posición abierta durante 6 meses. Por eso pagan por <strong>talento verificado</strong> que no aparece en LinkedIn.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- 9 · RED -->\n<section class=\"scene\" id=\"red\" data-nav=\"pilar-2\" data-theme=\"dark\" data-hook=\"net\" data-hold=\"80\" style=\"--h:400\">\n  <div class=\"stage dark net\" id=\"netStage\">\n    <div class=\"capn\" data-in=\"0.02,0.1\" data-out=\"0.3,0.36\"><h2>Conexión <em>directa.</em></h2><p>Con empresas que no publican en plataformas públicas.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"capn\" data-in=\"0.38,0.45\" data-out=\"0.63,0.69\"><h2>Referidos <em>validados.</em></h2><p>Talento verificado que las empresas ya conocen.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"capn\" data-in=\"0.72,0.8\"><h2>Red de <em>confianza.</em></h2><p>Una red que se construye sobre confianza, no sobre postulaciones.</p></div>\n    <svg class=\"lines\" id=\"netLines\"></svg>\n    <div id=\"netNodes\"></div>\n    <div class=\"hub\" id=\"hub\">VOS</div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- 10 · POR QUÉ FUNCIONA -->\n<section class=\"scene\" id=\"porque\" data-nav=\"pilar-2\" data-theme=\"dark\" data-hold=\"90\" style=\"--h:335\">\n  <div class=\"stage dark why\">\n    <div>\n      <h2 class=\"st1\" data-words=\"0.04,0.34\">Es matemáticamente viable.</h2>\n      <p class=\"st2\" data-words=\"0.3,0.6\">Las empresas pagan lo que sea por talento verificado que no aparece en LinkedIn.</p>\n      <div class=\"st3\" data-in=\"0.6,0.8\" style=\"opacity:var(--t);transform:scale(calc(.9 + var(--t)*.1))\">Vos sos ese talento.</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"iris cream\" data-iris></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- PRECIOS -->\n<section class=\"slide pricing\" id=\"precios\" data-nav=\"precios\" data-theme=\"light\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"reveal\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Precios</span></div>\n    <h2 class=\"title reveal\" style=\"--d:.08s\">Tres etapas. Una <span class=\"gold\">carrera comercial.</span></h2>\n    <p class=\"lead reveal\" style=\"--d:.16s\">Cada nivel se construye sobre el anterior. Elegís dónde empezar.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"tiers\">\n      <article class=\"tier tilt reveal from-left\" data-tilt=\"4\">\n        <h3>Comercial Junior</h3>\n        <div class=\"price\">$<span data-count=\"397\">0</span><small>USD</small></div>\n        <p class=\"per\">$198/mes × 2 meses</p>\n        <div class=\"dur\"><i class=\"on\" style=\"--n:0\"></i><i class=\"on\" style=\"--n:1\"></i><i style=\"--n:2\"></i><i style=\"--n:3\"></i><i style=\"--n:4\"></i></div>\n        <span class=\"dur-l\">2 de 5 meses</span>\n        <ul>\n          <li style=\"--n:0\">Fundamentos comerciales</li><li style=\"--n:1\">2 meses de acceso</li><li style=\"--n:2\">Soporte en comunidad</li><li style=\"--n:3\">Acceso al campus</li><li style=\"--n:4\">Video on-demand</li>\n        </ul>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"tier feat tilt reveal pop\" data-tilt=\"4\" style=\"--d:.12s\">\n        <span class=\"badge\">MÁS ELEGIDO</span>\n        <h3>Comercial High Ticket</h3>\n        <div class=\"price\">$<span data-count=\"547\">0</span><small>USD</small></div>\n        <p class=\"per\">$182/mes × 3 meses</p>\n        <div class=\"dur\"><i class=\"on\" style=\"--n:0\"></i><i class=\"on\" style=\"--n:1\"></i><i class=\"on\" style=\"--n:2\"></i><i style=\"--n:3\"></i><i style=\"--n:4\"></i></div>\n        <span class=\"dur-l\">3 de 5 meses</span>\n        <ul>\n          <li style=\"--n:0\">Apertura &amp; Discovery</li><li style=\"--n:1\">Diagnóstico y dolor</li><li style=\"--n:2\">Presentación de valor</li><li style=\"--n:3\">Objeciones + Método EVAA</li><li style=\"--n:4\">3 meses acceso + mentorías</li><li style=\"--n:5\">Campus + CRM</li><li style=\"--n:6\">Certificación</li>\n        </ul>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"tier tilt reveal from-right\" data-tilt=\"4\" style=\"--d:.24s\">\n        <h3>Carrera Completa</h3>\n        <div class=\"price\">$<span data-count=\"905\">0</span><small>USD</small></div>\n        <p class=\"per\">$181/mes × 5 meses</p>\n        <div class=\"dur\"><i class=\"on\" style=\"--n:0\"></i><i class=\"on\" style=\"--n:1\"></i><i class=\"on\" style=\"--n:2\"></i><i class=\"on\" style=\"--n:3\"></i><i class=\"on\" style=\"--n:4\"></i></div>\n        <span class=\"dur-l\">5 de 5 meses</span>\n        <ul>\n          <li style=\"--n:0\">Todos los sprints (14 total)</li><li style=\"--n:1\">5 meses de formación</li><li style=\"--n:2\">Mentorías 1a1 (6 sesiones)</li><li style=\"--n:3\">Portafolio de evidencia</li><li style=\"--n:4\">Preparación para mercado</li><li style=\"--n:5\">Acceso ilimitado post-formación</li><li style=\"--n:6\">Conexión con empresas</li><li style=\"--n:7\">Certificación premium</li>\n        </ul>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n</main>\n\n<footer>© ILFC · Instituto Latinoamericano de Formación Comercial</footer>\n\n<script>\n(function () {\n  var $ = function (s, c) { return Array.prototype.slice.call((c || document).querySelectorAll(s)); };\n  var clamp = function (v, a, b) { return Math.max(a, Math.min(b, v)); };\n  var smooth = function (t) { t = clamp(t, 0, 1); return t * t * (3 - 2 * t); };\n  var vh = window.innerHeight;\n\n  /* ---- palabras que se encienden con el scroll ---- */\n  function splitWords(el) {\n    var list = [];\n    (function walk(n) {\n      Array.prototype.slice.call(n.childNodes).forEach(function (c) {\n        if (c.nodeType === 3) {\n          var frag = document.createDocumentFragment();\n          c.textContent.split(/(\\s+)/).forEach(function (t) {\n            if (!t) return;\n            if (/^\\s+$/.test(t)) frag.appendChild(document.createTextNode(' '));\n            else { var s = document.createElement('span'); s.className = 'w'; s.textContent = t; frag.appendChild(s); list.push(s); }\n          });\n          c.parentNode.replaceChild(frag, c);\n        } else if (c.nodeType === 1 && !c.classList.contains('w')) walk(c);\n      });\n    })(el);\n    return list;\n  }\n\n  /* ---- red de conexiones (escena 9) ---- */\n  var NET = ['Marketing & Agencias','Software & SaaS','Real Estate','Fitness & Bienestar','Cursos Online & Bootcamps','Mentoría & Coaching','Automatización Financiera','Inteligencia de Ingresos','Atención al Cliente','Eventos & Experiencias'];\n  var net = { built: false, nodes: [], lines: [], dots: [] };\n  function buildNet() {\n    var st = document.getElementById('netStage'), W = st.clientWidth, H = st.clientHeight, cx = W / 2, cy = H * 0.65, rx = W * 0.4, ry = H * 0.245;\n    var nodesEl = document.getElementById('netNodes'), svg = document.getElementById('netLines');\n    nodesEl.innerHTML = ''; svg.innerHTML = ''; svg.setAttribute('viewBox', '0 0 ' + W + ' ' + H);\n    net.nodes = []; net.lines = []; net.dots = [];\n    var hub = document.getElementById('hub'); hub.style.left = cx + 'px'; hub.style.top = cy + 'px';\n    NET.forEach(function (label, i) {\n      var a = -Math.PI / 2 + (i / NET.length) * Math.PI * 2 + 0.31, x = cx + Math.cos(a) * rx, y = cy + Math.sin(a) * ry;\n      var d = document.createElement('div'); d.className = 'nnode'; d.textContent = label; d.style.left = x + 'px'; d.style.top = y + 'px'; nodesEl.appendChild(d); net.nodes.push(d);\n      var len = Math.hypot(x - cx, y - cy);\n      var ln = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'line');\n      ln.setAttribute('x1', cx); ln.setAttribute('y1', cy); ln.setAttribute('x2', x); ln.setAttribute('y2', y);\n      ln.style.strokeDasharray = len; ln.style.strokeDashoffset = len; ln._len = len; svg.appendChild(ln); net.lines.push(ln);\n      var c = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'circle'); c.setAttribute('r', 4); c.style.opacity = 0;\n      var am = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'animateMotion'); am.setAttribute('dur', (2.2 + (i % 4) * 0.35) + 's'); am.setAttribute('repeatCount', 'indefinite'); am.setAttribute('path', 'M' + cx + ',' + cy + ' L' + x + ',' + y);\n      c.appendChild(am); svg.appendChild(c); net.dots.push(c);\n    });\n    net.built = true;\n  }\n\n  /* ---- ganchos por escena ---- */\n  var camKeys = [[0,1,.5,.5],[.24,1,.5,.5],[.32,2.2,.82,.28],[.5,2.2,.82,.28],[.58,1.3,.6,.76],[.76,1.3,.6,.76],[.84,2,.1,.32],[1,2,.1,.32]];\n  var crmKeys = [[0,1,.5,.5],[.26,1,.5,.5],[.34,1.3,.61,.26],[.5,1.3,.61,.26],[.58,1.3,.61,.42],[.75,1.3,.61,.42],[.83,1.9,.79,.83],[1,1.9,.79,.83]];\n  function camMove(id, k, dotsId, cuts, p) {\n    var cam = document.getElementById(id), W = cam.offsetWidth, H = cam.offsetHeight, i = 0;\n    while (i < k.length - 2 && p > k[i + 1][0]) i++;\n    var a = k[i], b = k[i + 1], t = smooth((p - a[0]) / (b[0] - a[0])), s = a[1] + (b[1] - a[1]) * t, fx = a[2] + (b[2] - a[2]) * t, fy = a[3] + (b[3] - a[3]) * t;\n    var tx = clamp(W / 2 - fx * W * s, W - W * s, 0), ty = clamp(H / 2 - fy * H * s, H - H * s, 0);\n    cam.style.transform = 'translate(' + tx.toFixed(1) + 'px,' + ty.toFixed(1) + 'px) scale(' + s.toFixed(3) + ')';\n    var idx = p < cuts[0] ? 0 : p < cuts[1] ? 1 : p < cuts[2] ? 2 : 3;\n    $('#' + dotsId + ' i').forEach(function (d, j) { d.classList.toggle('on', j === idx); });\n  }\n  var hooks = {\n    campus: function (p) { camMove('cam', camKeys, 'stepdots', [0.29, 0.55, 0.81], p); },\n    crm: function (p) { camMove('cam2', crmKeys, 'stepdots2', [0.31, 0.56, 0.8], p); },\n    cost: function () {\n      var t = 0;\n      $('#costo .mo').forEach(function (m) { t += parseFloat(m.style.getPropertyValue('--t')) || 0; });\n      document.getElementById('costNum').textContent = '$' + Math.round(t * 15000).toLocaleString('en-US');\n    },\n    ice: function (p) {\n      var y = smooth((p - 0.22) / 0.62) * 96;\n      document.getElementById('world').style.transform = 'translateY(' + (-y).toFixed(2) + 'vh)';\n    },\n    net: function (p) {\n      if (!net.built) buildNet();\n      for (var i = 0; i < NET.length; i++) {\n        var t = smooth((p - (0.05 + i * 0.07)) / 0.1);\n        net.nodes[i].style.setProperty('--s', t.toFixed(3));\n        net.lines[i].style.strokeDashoffset = (net.lines[i]._len * (1 - t)).toFixed(1);\n        net.dots[i].style.opacity = t > 0.98 ? 1 : 0;\n      }\n    }\n  };\n\n  /* ---- registro de escenas ---- */\n  var scenes = $('.scene').map(function (el) {\n    var g = { el: el, top: 0, h: 0, items: [], hook: hooks[el.dataset.hook], hold: +(el.dataset.hold || 0), iris: !!el.querySelector('[data-iris]') };\n    $('[data-in],[data-out],[data-words],[data-iris]', el).forEach(function (n) {\n      var it = { el: n, isIris: n.hasAttribute('data-iris') };\n      if (n.dataset.in) { var r = n.dataset.in.split(','); it.a = +r[0]; it.b = +r[1]; }\n      if (n.dataset.out) { var q = n.dataset.out.split(','); it.ao = +q[0]; it.bo = +q[1]; }\n      if (n.dataset.words) { var w = n.dataset.words.split(','); it.wa = +w[0]; it.wb = +w[1]; it.words = splitWords(n); }\n      g.items.push(it);\n    });\n    return g;\n  });\n  function measure() { vh = window.innerHeight; scenes.forEach(function (g) { g.top = g.el.offsetTop; g.h = g.el.offsetHeight; }); if (net.built) buildNet(); render(cur); }\n  var cur = window.scrollY, tgt = cur, running = false;\n  window.__scenes = scenes; window.__render = function (y) { render(y); };\n\n  function setVar(el, k, v) { var s = v.toFixed(3); if (el._v && el._v[k] === s) return; (el._v = el._v || {})[k] = s; el.style.setProperty(k, s); }\n  var fmt = function (n, f) { n = Math.round(n); return f === 'usd' ? '$' + n.toLocaleString('en-US') : String(n); };\n\n  function render(sy) {\n    scenes.forEach(function (g) {\n      if (sy < g.top - vh * 1.5 || sy > g.top + g.h + vh * 0.5) return;\n      var R = Math.max(1, g.h - vh), T = g.iris ? 55 * vh / 100 : 0, C = Math.max(1, R - g.hold * vh / 100 - T);\n      var p = clamp((sy - g.top) / C, 0, 1), q = T ? clamp((sy - g.top - C - g.hold * vh / 100) / T, 0, 1) : 0;\n      setVar(g.el, '--p', p);\n      g.items.forEach(function (it) {\n        if (it.isIris) { setVar(it.el, '--t', smooth(q)); return; }\n        if (it.a !== undefined) {\n          var t = smooth((p - it.a) / (it.b - it.a)); setVar(it.el, '--t', t);\n          if (it.el.dataset.cnt) it.el.textContent = fmt(t * +it.el.dataset.cnt, it.el.dataset.fmt);\n        }\n        if (it.ao !== undefined) setVar(it.el, '--o', smooth((p - it.ao) / (it.bo - it.ao)));\n        if (it.words) {\n          var qw = (p - it.wa) / (it.wb - it.wa), n = it.words.length;\n          it.words.forEach(function (w, i) { setVar(w, '--t', clamp(qw * (n + 1.5) - i, 0, 1)); });\n        }\n      });\n      if (g.hook) g.hook(p);\n    });\n  }\n\n  /* ---- scroll suavizado ---- */\n  function loop() {\n    cur += (tgt - cur) * 0.14;\n    if (Math.abs(tgt - cur) < 0.3) cur = tgt;\n    try { render(cur); } catch (e) { console.error('render', e && e.message, e && e.stack); }\n    if (cur !== tgt) requestAnimationFrame(loop); else running = false;\n  }\n  var navs = $('[data-nav]'), dots = $('#dots a'), bar = document.getElementById('progress');\n  function onScroll() {\n    tgt = window.scrollY;\n    if (!running) { running = true; requestAnimationFrame(loop); }\n    var h = document.documentElement, pr = tgt / (h.scrollHeight - h.clientHeight || 1);\n    bar.style.transform = 'scaleX(' + clamp(pr, 0, 1) + ')';\n    var nav = null;\n    for (var i = 0; i < navs.length; i++) { var r = navs[i].getBoundingClientRect(); if (r.top <= 34 && r.bottom > 34) { nav = navs[i]; break; } }\n    if (nav) {\n      document.body.dataset.theme = nav.dataset.theme || 'light';\n      dots.forEach(function (d) { d.classList.toggle('active', d.getAttribute('href') === '#' + nav.dataset.nav); });\n    }\n  }\n  window.addEventListener('resize', measure); window.addEventListener('load', measure);\n  window.addEventListener('scroll', onScroll, { passive: true });\n  cur = tgt = window.scrollY; measure(); onScroll();\n\n  window.addEventListener('keydown', function (e) {\n    if (e.metaKey || e.ctrlKey || e.altKey) return;\n    var d = (e.key === 'ArrowRight' || e.key === 'PageDown') ? 1 : (e.key === 'ArrowLeft' || e.key === 'PageUp') ? -1 : 0;\n    if (!d) return; e.preventDefault();\n    window.scrollBy({ top: d * vh * 0.6, behavior: 'smooth' });\n  });\n\n  /* ---- precios: reveal, contadores, tilt ---- */\n  function countUp(el) {\n    var to = +el.dataset.count, dur = 1600, t0 = null;\n    function step(ts) { if (!t0) t0 = ts; var p = Math.min((ts - t0) / dur, 1), e = 1 - Math.pow(1 - p, 4); el.textContent = Math.round(to * e); if (p < 1) requestAnimationFrame(step); }\n    requestAnimationFrame(step);\n  }\n  var io = new IntersectionObserver(function (es) {\n    es.forEach(function (e) {\n      if (!e.isIntersecting) return;\n      var el = e.target; el.classList.add('in');\n      $('[data-count]', el).forEach(function (c) { if (!c.dataset.done) { c.dataset.done = 1; setTimeout(function () { countUp(c); }, 250); } });\n      io.unobserve(el);\n    });\n  }, { threshold: 0.18 });\n  $('.reveal').forEach(function (el) { io.observe(el); });\n\n  $('.tilt').forEach(function (el) {\n    var max = +el.dataset.tilt || 5;\n    el.addEventListener('pointermove', function (e) {\n      var r = el.getBoundingClientRect(), x = (e.clientX - r.left) / r.width, y = (e.clientY - r.top) / r.height;\n      el.style.setProperty('--mx', (x * 100) + '%'); el.style.setProperty('--my', (y * 100) + '%');\n      el.style.transform = 'perspective(900px) rotateX(' + ((0.5 - y) * max) + 'deg) rotateY(' + ((x - 0.5) * max) + 'deg) translateY(-4px)';\n      el.style.transition = 'transform 0.08s linear, box-shadow 0.4s';\n    });\n    el.addEventListener('pointerleave', function () { el.style.transform = ''; el.style.transition = ''; });\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n";
